<PolicyLayout title="Resource Licensing" description="Where to check current use permissions for Curious Brain Toolkit printable resources.">
  <p>Use permissions can vary by resource. Please read the terms shown on the relevant Etsy listing before buying or using a printable.</p>

  <h2>School and professional use</h2>
  <p>School, group and organisation licence terms are not published on this website, and school listings are not linked here. If you need to use a resource with a class, team or wider setting, contact the seller through the Curious Brain Etsy shop before purchase. Ask them to confirm the permitted number of users, copies and settings in writing.</p>

  <h2>Individual purchases</h2>
  <p>For an individual purchase, follow the use information on the Etsy listing and any terms supplied with the purchased file. If the listing does not answer your question, check with the seller before sharing or reproducing the material.</p>
</PolicyLayout>
